    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970429.0391\n\nTHE HAGUE, April 29 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Croatian warcrimes suspect to plead not guilty\n\n\n\n\nZlatko Aleksovski, extradited to The Hague to stand trial at the international warcrimes tribunal here, said Tuesday he would plead not guilty to the charges against him.",
